<title>INDIA: India's BPL 1996/97 1st half net down.</title>
<headline>India's BPL 1996/97 1st half net down.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 243.5    vs    274.1</p>
<p>    Net sales		6,060.0    vs  5,220.0</p>
<p>    Gross profit	     421.4    vs    429.1</p>
<p>    Interest costs	    99.6    vs     71.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation		40.8    vs     38.8</p>
<p>    Tax			   37.5    vs     45.0</p>
<p>Note: BPL is one of India's leading manufacturers of consumer appliances. The results are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
